    "Native zero-input macro call intent now persists with callID/name/requested args and GET restart kind=tool_calls; there is no ACC wait-entry ACK, dispatch receipt, roletool terminal outcome or held/release hard-abort total-gate acceptance.",
    "Requested args are model/protocol arguments, not proof of privacy-expanded/approval-updated/dispatcher-normalized actual arguments.",
    "GET-only restart covers the recorded no-replay interval; no user continuation/UI/model/steward deterministic prevention of duplicate effects is established.",
